      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030419,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "说起来，老师也不像以前那样经常训她了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304190180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030419020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030419,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "搞不好会像《麦克白》时的库尔特贝前辈一样，/n甚至比千寿前辈还抢眼……",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304190190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030419021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030419,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "怎么可能。主角是千寿前辈。/n老师也不可能允许与那国前辈过度表现自己。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304190200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030419022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030419,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "如果不允许，那老师为什么没让她收着点？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304190210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
